i-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15.10.46b862<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 21, 2025<br/>Summer Update 2025</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no legend.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Book%20World\">Book World</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no dangers.</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Illuminator%20Outfits\">Illuminator Outfits</a> and the achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Illuminator\">Illuminator</a>. <br/><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Illuminator Male Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Illuminator_Male_Addon_3_066fc1.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Illuminator Female Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Illuminator_Female_Addon_3_38fe95.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Base_Outfit\">Base Outfit</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Illuminator Male\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Illuminator_Male_7cfdd4.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Illuminator Female\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Illuminator_Female_4815db.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p><p>To obtain the base outfit, you need to complete the <a href=\"#/quest/between-the-lines-quest\">Between the Lines Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Addon_1\">Addon 1</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Illuminator Male Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Illuminator_Male_Addon_1_010f11.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Illuminator Female Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Illuminator_Female_Addon_1_93ecb8.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p><p>Use a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Scallop%20Shell\"><img alt=\"Scallop Shell\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scallop_Shell_4bb9f7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Scallop%20Shell\">Scallop Shell</a> and you will receive the first addon. This can be looted from  these can be looted from <a href=\"#/wiki/Tropical%20Desolator\">Tropical Desolator</a>.\n</p><p>When using the shell you will get the following message:<br/>\n<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Your illuminator robes look more impressive now.</span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Addon_2\">Addon 2</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Illuminator Male Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Illuminator_Male_Addon_2_97fba1.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Illuminator Female Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Illuminator_Female_Addon_2_ab3127.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</p><p>Use a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sand-Filled%20Horn\"><img alt=\"Sand-Filled Horn\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sand_Filled_Horn_a797e8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Sand-Filled%20Horn\">Sand-Filled Horn</a> and you will receive the second addon. This can be looted from  these can be looted from <a href=\"#/wiki/Wrathful%20Archivist\">Wrathful Archivist</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Upon receiving both addons, you'll receive the achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Illuminator\">Illuminator</a>.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["between-the-lines-quest"]}